{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209042143a1f874356f274304","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Design Thinking for Clínica Glamoré - Estética Avançada (Dra. Jéssica Baleia)\n\n**Aesthetic Direction**: \n\nFor Clínica Glamoré, I'm choosing a **\"Rose Quartz & Gilded Noir\"** aesthetic - a completely new palette inspired by the luxurious warmth of rose quartz crystals and the sophistication of gilded gold accents on deep noir backgrounds. This creates a feminine, glamorous, and transformative feel that perfectly matches the clinic name \"Glamoré.\"\n\n**Design Rationale**:\n- **Purpose**: Premium facial harmonization and aesthetic treatments in Ribeirão Preto\n- **Tone**: Glamorous, feminine, luxurious, transformative - evoking beauty and confidence\n- **Color Palette**: Rose Quartz (#E8C8D8, #F0D8E8) paired with Gilded Gold (#D4A84B, #E8C270) on Deep Noir (#0A0A0F, #050508)\n- **Typography**: **Crimson Pro** (display) - elegant serif with sophisticated warmth + **Outfit** (body) - modern geometric sans-serif with contemporary readability\n- **Border Radius**: **Glamour Glow** shapes - organic, luminous patterns reminiscent of crystal facets and glow effects\n\nLet me create the folder and implement the site:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f81e241d-2265-45a2-a9ca-d2339637f3ea","uuid":"dc99ac94-fd5d-498f-a40d-875e11fa2993"}
